  "description": "EntityAxis.Abstractions provides generic, strongly-typed interfaces for working with domain entities in Clean Architecture applications. It defines standard contracts for querying and mutating entities using identifier-based access, with support for pagination and composition.\n\n      These abstractions are framework-agnostic and serve as the foundation for higher-level implementations built with MediatR, EF Core, or custom infrastructure.\n\n      Ideal for developers building scalable .NET applications using CQRS and Clean Architecture principles.",
